# Everything the tachometer harness writes: built pages per ref, packed workspace tarballs, the
# isolated installs and the run reports. The directory ignores itself from the inside too, but the
# entry is listed here because ESLint is fed from the root .gitignore and never reads nested ones.
/test/tachometer/.tachometer/
